# VTVS design

Follow [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md). Space is used by the split, not by empty mastheads.

**Type:** Satoshi 1.125rem / 500 for nav, lead, phones, actions. Newsreader optical ~72, roman, for H1. Slogan is Newsreader italic at the same size. Never italicize the H1. Never Inter, Roboto, Cormorant, Manrope. Do not antialias body text — it reads gray on paper.

**Color:** `--paper #EFEBE3`, `--ink #1C1915` for all reading text, `--mark #6E1F1C` on hover only. Do not fade body, lead, phones, slogan, or nav. No 0.75rem tracked captions.

**Hero ≥960px:** `0.42fr / 1fr`, copy top-aligned. Photo takes the remaining width to the viewport edge. Not 50/50. Not vertically centered.

**Actions:** ink text links, underline on hover. Phones are the real CTA.

```css
/* ❌ */
.hero-lead { color: #5e5952; }
.trust-bar { font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.7; }
.hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
.hero-copy { justify-content: center; }

/* ✅ */
.hero-lead, .ink-link, .slogan { color: var(--ink); }
.hero { grid-template-columns: minmax(20rem, 0.42fr) 1fr; }
.hero-copy { justify-content: flex-start; }
```

No eyebrows, meta lines, decorative rules, photo gradients, box-shadows, pill buttons, or entrance fades.
